# 🛠 SKILL — Nano Decomposition

> **Authority**: ha:/ha/skills/nano/stg-nano-scalization.ail (canonical SoT)
> **Branch**: `go:/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/`
> **RRP**: `t:/gopia/olym/k/cogninfer/skills/nano-decomposition.ail`

---

## SK-ND-1 — Principle

> **nano-first, reality-always**

Mọi artifact cấp ME/Macro PHẢI được phân rã thành NAP trước khi forge.

## SK-ND-2 — CASL Ladder

```yaml
ladder:
  - level: MIC
    loc: "5-20"
    fns: 1
    deps: 0
    actor: "T3C"
    description: "Smallest functional unit"
  - level: NAP
    loc: "30-120"
    fns: "≤5"
    deps: "≤3"
    actor: "T3C"
    afc: "EE.CC.RR.FF.nXX"
    description: "Nano Artifact Particle — atomic, stateless, deterministic, composable"
  - level: CAP
    loc: "150-1000"
    fns: "3-12 NAP"
    deps: "<NAP>"
    actor: "CTO"
    afc: "EE.CC.RR.FF"
    description: "Crystallized Artifact Particle — sealed bundle"
  - level: NEP
    loc: "1000-5000"
    fns: "3-15 CAP"
    deps: "<CAP>"
    actor: "CSA"
    description: "Nano Engine Part"
  - level: ME
    loc: "5-20 NEP"
    deps: "<NEP>"
    actor: "CSA / Royal"
    description: "Macro Engine"
  - level: SPACE
    loc: "GitHub org / Cosda space"
    deps: "<ME>"
    actor: "CSO"
    description: "Distribution space"
```

## SK-ND-3 — Decomposition Recipe

```text
INPUT: mega-artifact (≥ 5000 LOC)
   ↓
Step 1: Identify functional boundaries
   ↓
Step 2: Split into NEPs (1000-5000 LOC each)
   ↓
Step 3: Each NEP → split into CAPs (150-1000 LOC)
   ↓
Step 4: Each CAP → split into NAPs (30-120 LOC)
   ↓
Step 5: Each NAP → split into MICs (5-20 LOC)
   ↓
OUTPUT: composition tree NAP → CAP → NEP → ME
```

## SK-ND-4 — NAP Properties

```yaml
nap_properties:
  atomic: true            # 1 intent duy nhất
  stateless: true         # Không có internal state
  deterministic: true     # Cùng input → cùng output
  composable: true        # Kết hợp được với NAP khác
  testable: true          # Có thể test độc lập
  sealed: false           # Chưa qua CSA seal (đang ở /x)
```

## SK-ND-5 — Hard Rules

| Code | Rule |
|---|---|
| R001 | CAP > 1000 LOC → REJECT, decompose to NAP |
| R002 | NAP must be atomic, stateless, deterministic |
| R003 | Only stable CAP/NEP may enter /c |
| R004 | nano-first, never top-down monolith |
| R005 | MIC không có external dependency |
| R006 | NAP không quá 3 deps |
| R007 | CAP phải có ≥ 3 NAP |

## SK-ND-6 — Example

```yaml
mega_engine: "hace-me-rcme"
decomposition:
  - nep: "rcme.orch"
    caps:
      - cap: "rcme.orch.boot"
        naps:
          - nap: "rcme.boot.energy"
          - nap: "rcme.boot.dag"
          - nap: "rcme.boot.allocate"
      - cap: "rcme.orch.schedule"
      - cap: "rcme.orch.dispatch"
  - nep: "rcme.l1"
    caps:
      - cap: "rcme.l1.constitution"
      - cap: "rcme.l1.verify"
  - nep: "rcme.sdm"
    caps:
      - cap: "rcme.sdm.hot_cache"
      - cap: "rcme.sdm.snapshot"
```

